      "source": "Implementation of <a href=\"../../../relational/repository/query/RelationalQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.repository.query\"><code>RelationalQueryCreator</code></a> that creates <a href=\"ParametrizedQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.query\"><code>ParametrizedQuery</code></a> from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a>.",
