    {
      "source": "<code>isSliceQuery</code> - flag denoting if the query returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Slice.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
